            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Kei",
            "review_text": "gavap73\nAdelaide, Australia33 contributions\n0\nAll I could eat until I could eat no more\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nWent in for an All You Can Eat adventure at Sushi Kei. We came in early for lunch so we were the only ones there. The staff were very hospitable and friendly and the restaurant was very clean and modern. The food ranged from a large range of sushi to fish dishes like Saba Shioyaki. Obviously the food was delivered quickly being the only ones there but the quality was really high and we were delighted with the freshness and flavours delivered today. Definatelty rated this restaurant as a place to visit in Hanoi.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
