            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Kei",
            "review_text": "Sonny_Foodie\nFreehold, New Jersey159 contributions\n0\nBelow average, exactly what you would expect from a mall restaurant!\nJul 2017 • Friends\nUnfortunately when temperatures rise above 37C+ or 100F+, i tend to look for the coolest place to go and eat, it is 2 KM away from my accommodations are close to the Aeon mall. I have tried almost every restaurant in the mall, some are average and some are terrible. Staff is not knowledgeable about the food they are serving, so don't expect anything other than exactly what is on the menu, might as well be ordering by number. The most recent stop for lunch, was advised sorry no Tuna. Not sure if they realize, it's a sushi restaurant. Average at best, make sure you ask if they have Tuna today before you are seated. Above average prices, with less then average food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 31, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
