            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Kei",
            "review_text": "Quang Kiet Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1197 contributions\n0\nExcellent Japanese food\nJul 2016 • Couples\nExcellent - it was all what I could say about Sushi Kei at Aeon Mall Long Bien. The restaurant was not too big but nicely decorated and easily found on the mall's 3rd floor. Staff was good although not really friendly. Food was very good and please kindly be noted that the portion in reality was bigger than showed in picture! We were generally very happy to have a great lunch with tasty Japanese dishes here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 17, 2016",
